    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "DNG Boyce Gallagher are delighted to present to market this attractive three-bedroom semi-detached residence located within the established Greenhills development in Manorcunningham. Built using timber frame construction and presented in very good condition throughout, this property offers bright, well-proportioned accommodation ideal for first-time buyers and investors alike. \n\nSituated in Manorcunningham village, the property enjoys exceptional convenience with Letterkenny just a short drive away, providing easy access to major employers including ATU and LUH. The location also benefits from excellent connectivity to Derry City, making it an ideal choice for commuters. \n\nAccommodation comprises an inviting entrance hall, spacious living room with bay window and feature fireplace, kitchen/dining room with integrated appliances, utility room and guest WC. Upstairs there are three generous bedrooms, including a master bedroom with ensuite shower room, together with a family bathroom and additional attic storage. Externally, the property benefits from off-street parking and low-maintenance gardens.\n\nFor further information or to arrange a viewing, contact sole selling agents DNG Boyce Gallagher.\n\nAccommodation:\n\nEntrance Hall 2.07m x 4.62m (6'9\" x 15'2\")\n\nLiving Room 4.23m x 4.68m (13'11\" x 15'4\")\n\nKitchen / Dining Room 3.93m x 4.66m (12'11\" x 15'3\")\n\nUtility Room 1.63m x 2.28m (5'4\" x 7'6\")\n\nGuest WC 1.53m x 1.63m (5' x 5'4\")\n\nFirst Floor \n\n\nLanding 3.81m x 1.22m (12'6\" x 4')\n\nMaster Bedroom 3.64m x 3.48m (11'11\" x 11'5\")\n\nEnsuite 1.56m x 1.75m (5'1\" x 5'9\")\n\nBedroom 2 3.63m x 3.27m (11'11\" x 10'9\")\n\nBedroom 3 2.68m x 3.49m (8'10\" x 11'5\")\n\nFamily Bathroom 3.28m x 2.65m (10'9\" x 8'8\")\n"
      },
